@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@tournamentId = 1
@matchId = 1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_STAFF_OR_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Public snapshot: includes version, nextMatchId/nextSlot, scores and champion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/bracket

### Generate once; only SingleElimination/OpenReg, at least 2 eligible teams
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/bracket
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Record completed set 1. Use the latest snapshot version.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tournaments/{{tournamentId}}/bracket/matches/{{matchId}}/sets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team1Points": 21,
  "team2Points": 15,
  "expectedVersion": 1
}
